 "insight": [
  "The top five most imported and exported categories in Luxembourg from 2005 to 2025 are machinery and mechanical appliances, electrical machinery and equipment, iron and steel, plastics and articles thereof (exports only), and vehicles and parts.",
  "Total exports amount to 317.53 billion euros, with machinery and mechanical appliances leading at 53.73 billion euros or 16.9%.",
  "Imports total 444.08 billion euros, with machinery and mechanical appliances also first at 54.53 billion euros or 12.3%, followed closely by vehicles and parts and mineral fuels and oils.",
  "The top three exports make up 41.2% of total exports, while the top three imports account for 34.4% of total imports.",
  "Data values are nominal and include a small confidential portion, which is reported separately and not omitted."
 ],
